('610f9db1-2104-51fd-a668-b95d56941442'::uuid,1,'You ordered a congratulations cake for your friend. The bakery printed ''GOOD LUCK WITH THE DIVORCE'' across it, and the delivery person is already at your friend''s door asking for a speech.','you ordered a congratulations cake for your friend the bakery printed ''good luck with the divorce'' across it and the delivery person is already at your friend''s door asking for a speech','{"intensity":"mild"}'::jsonb,'published','Restored from the original live Decked release'),
('24aada30-3e26-570a-bc63-59ffed803f73'::uuid,1,'You enter the wrong meeting room, introduce yourself as the guest speaker, and discover it is a surprise retirement party.','you enter the wrong meeting room introduce yourself as the guest speaker and discover it is a surprise retirement party','{"intensity":"mild"}'::jsonb,'published','Restored from the original live Decked release'),
